    "notes": "Choose the role by meaning: one value of a setting = radiogroup (this file); switching visible content = tabs; independent on/off buttons = toolbar with toggle buttons. RTL: the first segment is on the right; ArrowLeft selects the next. Ant Design's segmented control does not swap (read from source), Material UI and Radix do; we mirror. The sliding selection indicator animates along the inline axis."
